# spine.json / SPINE.md come from the OLDER regex-based builder and are partial --
# 7,395 entry points against spine-true.json's 25,221, because Paketti registers most
# entries dynamically and a regex cannot see them. Derived and incomplete: not the
# spine, not committed. spine-true.json below is the spine.
.spine/spine.json
.spine/SPINE.md
# .spine/spine-true.json is deliberately TRACKED — it is the complete machine-readable
# inventory of Paketti's surface, and the whole point is that it is diffable over time
# and available from any checkout. It never ships in the .xrnx (see .github/workflows).
